# CarePair landing — Cursor rules

## Local-only docs
**Vortex** files in this folder (`VORTEX*.md`) are **gitignored** — local planning only. Public deploy/env guidance: **`README.md`** and **`.env.example`**. Product alignment: monorepo **`mobile/src/theme/tokens.ts`** and **`src/lib/site.ts`** for marketing copy.

## Stack
- Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind.
- Deploy: Vercel (default). No secrets required for a static marketing build.

## Paths
- `src/app/` — routes, layout, `robots.ts`, `sitemap.ts`, `not-found.tsx`
- `src/lib/site.ts` — marketing copy; `siteUrl.ts` — canonical origin
- `src/components/` — header, footer, store CTAs, JSON-LD
- `vercel.json` — security headers
